WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:02.986
Make a correction that changes the faulty action.

00:00:03.323 --> 00:00:07.321
Remove the writing-style priority rule and unsupported one-day

00:00:07.365 --> 00:00:11.857
promise. Use the supplied deadline and work-impact criteria

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:15.270
consistently, with human review for missing or conflicting

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.397
information. Retest the corrected rule with the same

00:00:18.532 --> 00:00:21.317
two variations and error case, and save what

00:00:21.361 --> 00:00:24.370
actually happens. Separate a verified finding from an

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.849
unresolved question and a proposed action. The supplied

00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:31.757
policy does not establish the promise; broader behavior

00:00:31.846 --> 00:00:35.888
remains unproven. Keep the before-and-after correction, test limits

00:00:35.978 --> 00:00:39.464
and human continue, revise or pause decision. Carry

00:00:39.508 --> 00:00:42.383
the same SAFE record and project evidence into

00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:43.334
the next lesson.
